    { math: '1 · Gesture before anatomy', note: 'The 30-second capture of the pose\'s INTENT — the reach, the twist, the weight. Gesture-first is the discipline: a correct anatomical figure with no gesture is a waxwork.' },
    { math: '2 · Proportion canons', note: 'The classical heads-tall canon (~7.5–8 heads adult; children fewer — a child drawn with adult proportions is instantly uncanny). The canon is a check-list average; real bodies deviate, and the deviations are the likeness.' },
